belong to the unchanged full task.

Proof. Since $d_1\ge9$, the two words

$$
u_0=\rho A_1Q_1A_2\cdots A_{d_1},\qquad
u_1=\rho A_1A_2Q_1A_3\cdots A_{d_1}
\tag{IV.39}
